      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUBBLE OVER (2) made a nice return at her latest appearance three weeks ago, finishing 9 metres away in third over 1680m at Terang. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Her last-start form is good enough to take out a race like this. MISSMALACHITE (7) made it five minor placings on the trot last start when she led and battled on well but found a couple better at Charlton over 2100m. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Taking on a better field but she is up to the task. MAJOR ROY (3) is a great chance after a string of sound recent performances, the latest a solid fifth at Hamilton over 2160m. Hard to find fault. DARETODANCE (6) will be rock-hard fit after four runs back from a spell, the latest effort a fourth at Ballarat a week-and-a-half ago.",
